# 17. RNG STRUCTURE

The system uses multiple gates.

```text
GATE 1
Potential Eligibility
        ↓
GATE 2
Combat Condition
        ↓
GATE 3
Emotional Condition
        ↓
GATE 4
Core World Compatibility
        ↓
GATE 5
