        ↓
GATE 6
Event Trigger
        ↓
RARE SKILL
```

Failure at any gate results in:

```text
NO AWAKENING
```

The 0.1% rate is applied only after the Hero passes the required eligibility gates.

---

# 18. FIXED 0.1% RNG RATE

The final awakening probability is:

```text
0.1%
```

This means:

```text
Successful eligible check:
1 in 1,000
```

The system should be configured so that:

```text
Most eligible checks:
NO AWAKENING
```

Even when:

```text
Emotional Condition = TRUE
Combat Condition = TRUE
World Compatibility = TRUE
```

the final RNG can still produce:

```text
FAIL
```

The conditions determine whether the Hero may roll.

The RNG determines whether the Hero awakens.

---

# 19. RNG MODEL

The final RNG model is:

```text
Eligibility:
TRUE

Combat Condition:
TRUE

Emotional Compatibility:
TRUE

World Compatibility:
TRUE

Final Awakening Rate:
0.1%
```

Result:

```text
0.1% → SUCCESS
99.9% → FAIL
```

Condition bonuses may influence eligibility or the quality of the resulting skill, but they must not increase the final awakening rate above 0.1%.

