# 20. RNG MUST NOT BE GUARANTEED

Bad design:

```text
10 Battles
↓
Guaranteed Awakening
```

Correct design:

```text
Battle 1 → FAIL
Battle 2 → FAIL
Battle 3 → FAIL
Battle 4 → FAIL
...
Battle 50 → FAIL
...
Battle 100 → FAIL
...
Battle ??? → 0.1% POSSIBLE SUCCESS
```

There is no fixed pity counter unless a future system explicitly introduces one.

The 0.1% rate does not accumulate into a guarantee.

